      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8368001::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Edge dislocations can play a dominant role in the elevated-temperature plastic deformation of BCC refractory high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11206460::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher barriers to edge-dislocation motion slow defect mobility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8368001::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced short-range order increases yield strength in refractory high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::018::discussion",
        "PMC7921137::web::006::introduction",
        "PMC8368001::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced short-range order stabilizes thermoelastic properties relative to an as-cast disordered state.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Short-range order alters the temperature dependence of elastic modulus.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat-treated specimens with enhanced short-range order will have higher yield strength than the as-cast baseline.",
